            "review_title": "Review at Gordon's New York Pizza Cityside",
            "review_text": "Dilara T\n9 contributions\n0\nWhere Tastes and Smiles Meet\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nThe pizza and burgers were really great, and their flavours were quite balanced and hearty. Vietnamese coffee was especially beautiful, with a strong and full aroma. We had the opportunity to go both morning and evening, and both times the quality and service were equally good. The staff were attentive and friendly, and we felt very comfortable. The ambience of the place was delightful and clean, with ease to choose both for breakfast and dinner. It’s a place we’d love to come back and I’d love to recommend it with comfort.\nRead more\nTranslated from Turkish\nShow original\nWritten February 12, 2026",
