            "review_text": "rhysmillington\nGlasgow, United Kingdom14 contributions\n0\nGreat Pizza in DaNang\nDec 2024 • Couples\nWent here I. The way back from the Dragon Bridge show. Great atmosphere and decor. Felt very New York! Had starter, pizza and cocktails and all were delicious. The guy serving us was very helpful in making recommendations for us to try. Would definately recommend anyone who is a fan of Pizza to try this place.\nWritten December 15, 2024\nGordon L\nThank you for the wonderful review! We are thrilled that you loved your experience with us and the New York vibes. It would our pleasure to serve you <3\n\n-Team Gordon's New York Pizza\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
